    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>Main Article: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/JATM_The_Baran_Do_Sages\" title=\"JATM The Baran Do Sages\">The Baran Do Sages</a></i> </p><p>The Baran Do Sages are an obscure group of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kel_Dor\" title=\"Kel Dor\">Kel Dor</a> seers and mystics who engage in deep contemplation with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to look into the future and assist their people. They empty their minds to allow <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to provide it's wisdom and secrets. These quiet masters of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> sit in silence, listening to the ebb and flow of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a>, before leaping into action. Although humble and introspective, The Baran Do Sages are full of confidence, relying on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to guide their deeds. </p><p>Members of The Baran Do Sages&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Tradition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Tradition\">Force Tradition</a>&nbsp;can select&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a>&nbsp;from the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Baran_Do_Sage_Talent_Tree\" title=\"Baran Do Sage Talent Tree\">Baran Do Sage Talent Tree</a>. </p><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Membership\"><b>Membership</b></span></h4><p>Any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kel_Dor\" title=\"Kel Dor\">Kel Dor</a> with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> feat is eligible to join The Baran Do Sages. </p>",
